  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of security forces to promote respect for rule of law and human rights under Sec. 1206 of the National Defense Authorization Act</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program provides training for security forces and associated security ministries of foreign countries to promote respect for rule of law and human rights, in accordance with current Leahy human rights provisions of Section 1206 of the National Defense Authorization Act (NDAA).</narrative>
  </description>
